        "content": "## Screener: Mark + Compare  (spec §9 event 2 · §10.2 item 4)\nGHL Contact Changed → Screener Outcome (the pick the screener made) → the shared Compare Step. The mark itself is re-read from the contact there, so only contact_id matters here. If the compare fails, the newest call row of that contact gets writeback_ok = false so Screener: Write-back Retry reruns it.\nKeep INACTIVE until the four GHL guard branches exist.",
